      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think this condition will work for FBF. All Tint/Dawn knows about the shader at this point is it has a @color(N) attribute. Take [this shader](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/dawn/src/dawn/tests/end2end/FramebufferFetchTests.cpp;l\u003d341-344;drc\u003d3252383e3842a722e39f404882a1ae10f5fdbace) it doesn\u0027t have @builtin(sample_index) and it doesn\u0027t use @interpolate(perspective, sample). One of those is necessary for UseSampleRateShading() to be true IIUC. As a result needsMultisampledFramebufferFetch will be false for that shader when it needs to be true.",
      "range": {
